# Links that are alive but that lychee cannot verify from a CI runner.
# Add a one-line reason for every entry — an unexplained ignore is how a list
# quietly accumulates dead links behind a green check.

# Aggressive bot protection / datacenter-IP blocking
https://www\.linkedin\.com/.*
https://x\.com/.*
https://twitter\.com/.*
https://www\.amazon\.com/.*
https://www\.forbes\.com/.*

# Cloudflare challenge pages for non-browser user agents
https://ahrefs\.com/.*
https://www\.semrush\.com/.*

# Requires a logged-in session
https://analytics\.google\.com/.*
https://search\.google\.com/search-console.*
https://www\.bing\.com/webmasters.*

# Rate-limits CI runners hard
https://news\.ycombinator\.com/.*
https://www\.reddit\.com/.*
